{"total_count":8,"incomplete_results":false,"items":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/issues/63711","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/issues/63711/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/issues/63711/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/issues/63711/events","html_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/pull/63711","id":3428003465,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAQzde86pKqhW","number":63711,"title":"[release/10.0] Update to Wix v5","user":{"login":"wtgodbe","id":14283640,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MjgzNjQw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14283640?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wtgodbe","html_url":"https://github.com/wtgodbe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wtgodbe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wtgodbe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wtgodbe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wtgodbe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wtgodbe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wtgodbe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wtgodbe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wtgodbe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wtgodbe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":985473549,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw5ODU0NzM1NDk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/labels/Servicing-approved","name":"Servicing-approved","color":"048708","default":false,"description":"Shiproom has approved the issue","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1094843547,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMDk0ODQzNTQ3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/labels/area-infrastructure","name":"area-infrastructure","color":"5319e7","default":false,"description":"Includes: MSBuild projects/targets, build scripts, CI, Installers and shared framework","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1101901051,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMTAxOTAxMDUx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/labels/feature-installers","name":"feature-installers","color":"bfdadc","default":false,"description":"Includes: Installers","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/milestones/359","html_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/milestone/359","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/milestones/359/labels","id":13438889,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAQzde84AzQ-p","number":359,"title":"10.0-rc2","description":null,"creator":{"login":"javiercn","id":6995051,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5OTUwNTE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6995051?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/javiercn","html_url":"https://github.com/javiercn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/javiercn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/javiercn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/javiercn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/javiercn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/javiercn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/javiercn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/javiercn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/javiercn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/javiercn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":0,"closed_issues":118,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-08-06T16:16:46Z","updated_at":"2025-10-22T15:33:25Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2025-10-22T15:33:25Z"},"comments":0,"created_at":"2025-09-17T22:48:17Z","updated_at":"2025-09-18T17:41:05Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:40:23Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/pulls/63711","html_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/pull/63711","diff_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/pull/63711.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/pull/63711.patch","merged_at":"2025-09-18T17:40:23Z"},"body":"Backport of https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/pull/62885\r\n\r\nPart of https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/issues/62430\r\n\r\n# Update to Wix v5\r\n\r\nUpgrades the wix toolset from V3 to V5, which we use to build our installers. Includes syntax/API updates, UI improvements, and new loc strings\r\n\r\n## Description\r\n\r\nWix V3 has been out of support for some time, and will no longer receive security fixes. As such, we need to update to the in-support v5. runtime, windowsdesktop, and sdk are making similar changes.\r\n\r\nFixes https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/issues/62430\r\n\r\n## Customer Impact\r\n\r\nAt the moment, hopefully none other than minor UI tweaks. In the future, will allow us to receive critical security fixes from Wix.\r\n\r\n## Regression?\r\n\r\n- [ ] Yes\r\n- [X] No\r\n\r\n## Risk\r\n\r\n- [X] High\r\n- [ ] Medium\r\n- [ ] Low\r\n\r\nWe've done manual validation of the new installers, along w/ CTI coverage, but the Hosting Bundle is complicated and has lots of moving parts, interactions, and scenarios. It's possible that this change introduces a regression in some lesser-used IIS scenario\r\n\r\n## Verification\r\n\r\n- [X] Manual (required)\r\n- [X] Automated\r\n\r\n## Packaging changes reviewed?\r\n\r\n- [ ] Yes\r\n- [ ] No\r\n- [X] N/A","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/issues/63711/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/issues/63711/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/issues/29649","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/issues/29649/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/issues/29649/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/issues/29649/events","html_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/pull/29649","id":794597374,"node_id":"MDExOlB1bGxSZXF1ZXN0NTYyMDg3MTUw","number":29649,"title":"Build VS redist for ANCM","user":{"login":"jkotalik","id":8302101,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzMDIxMDE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8302101?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jkotalik","html_url":"https://github.com/jkotalik","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jkotalik/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jkotalik/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jkotalik/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jkotalik/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jkotalik/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jkotalik/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jkotalik/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jkotalik/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jkotalik/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":5572431303,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAQzde88AAAABTCSNxw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/labels/area-networking","name":"area-networking","color":"5319e7","default":false,"description":"Includes servers, yarp, json patch, bedrock, websockets, http client factory, and http abstractions","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":8,"created_at":"2021-01-26T22:10:22Z","updated_at":"2023-08-24T23:37:12Z","closed_at":"2021-04-22T16:40:49Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/pulls/29649","html_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/pull/29649","diff_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/pull/29649.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/pull/29649.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Right now, we insert ANCM via a convoluted method with creating a nupkg via an internal feed. This attempts to create a nuget package for ANCM for IIS and IIS Express.\r\n\r\nThis needs more work, but this is for testing on CI that the nupkgs created are correct. There is reactionary to actually insert these correctly into VS.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/issues/29649/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/issues/29649/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/issues/37114","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/issues/37114/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/issues/37114/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/issues/37114/events","html_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/pull/37114","id":1011548246,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAQzde84semWO","number":37114,"title":"[release/6.0] Check solution filters","user":{"login":"dougbu","id":6431421,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0MzE0MjE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6431421?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dougbu","html_url":"https://github.com/dougbu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dougbu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dougbu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dougbu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dougbu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dougbu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dougbu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dougbu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dougbu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dougbu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":1094843547,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMDk0ODQzNTQ3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/labels/area-infrastructure","name":"area-infrastructure","color":"5319e7","default":false,"description":"Includes: MSBuild projects/targets, build scripts, CI, Installers and shared framework","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1465509900,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNDY1NTA5OTAw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/labels/tell-mode","name":"tell-mode","color":"e989f9","default":false,"description":"Indicates a PR which is being merged during tell-mode","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/milestones/130","html_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/milestone/130","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/milestones/130/labels","id":6022856,"node_id":"MDk6TWlsZXN0b25lNjAyMjg1Ng==","number":130,"title":"6.0.0","description":"","creator":{"login":"pranavkm","id":174281,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDI4MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/174281?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranavkm","html_url":"https://github.com/pranavkm","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranavkm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranavkm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranavkm/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranavkm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranavkm/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranavkm/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranavkm/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranavkm/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranavkm/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":0,"closed_issues":290,"state":"closed","created_at":"2020-10-22T23:42:49Z","updated_at":"2022-01-18T19:07:22Z","due_on":"2021-11-10T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2021-11-09T01:03:23Z"},"comments":1,"created_at":"2021-09-29T23:59:42Z","updated_at":"2021-09-30T01:57:25Z","closed_at":"2021-09-30T01:57:23Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/pulls/37114","html_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/pull/37114","diff_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/pull/37114.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/pull/37114.patch","merged_at":"2021-09-30T01:57:23Z"},"body":"- backport of #36449 and #36756\r\n\r\nDougbu/check.solution.filters (#36449)\r\n\r\n  * Check solution filters\r\n  - confirm all mentioned projects are in AspNetCore.sln\r\n  - clean up CodeCheck.ps1\r\n    - avoid aliases\r\n    - rework long lines\r\n    - avoid deprecated `dotnet run -p`\r\n    - improve output a bit\r\n    - correct whitespace\r\n  - there can be only one\r\n    - we have just one solution file\r\n    - solution file should mention projects _once_\r\n\r\n  * Add missing projects to AspNetCore.sln\r\n  - Middleware.slnf contained projects that no longer exist eg. NodeServices\r\n    - VS also sorted the file and VS 2019 added ARM64 configurations\r\n  - a few other solution filters still referenced removed and moved projects\r\n  - correct capitalization in some solution filters\r\n\r\n  Note: Unable to load some WiX projects in VS 2019 or _any_ in VS 2022 (WiX extension unavailable for 2022)\r\n\r\n  * Remove trailing comma in a solution filter\r\n\r\nPut concatenated `string`s in parentheses (#36756)\r\n\r\n  - follow-up to 779db7f3e60c\r\n  - errors occur but point to the `+` sign instead of displaying real problem","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/issues/37114/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/issues/37114/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/issues/18619","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/issues/18619/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/issues/18619/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/issues/18619/events","html_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/issues/18619","id":556160317,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWU1NTYxNjAzMTc=","number":18619,"title":"Windows Installers: Cannot resolve targets for wixproj files","user":{"login":"M-Schiller","id":11773136,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzczMTM2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11773136?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/M-Schiller","html_url":"https://github.com/M-Schiller","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/M-Schiller/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/M-Schiller/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/M-Schiller/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/M-Schiller/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/M-Schiller/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/M-Schiller/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/M-Schiller/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/M-Schiller/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/M-Schiller/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":1094843547,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMDk0ODQzNTQ3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/labels/area-infrastructure","name":"area-infrastructure","color":"5319e7","default":false,"description":"Includes: MSBuild projects/targets, build scripts, CI, Installers and shared framework","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1710368741,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzEwMzY4NzQx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/labels/Needs:%20Attention%20:wave:","name":"Needs: Attention :wave:","color":"3665db","default":false,"description":"This issue needs the attention of a contributor, typically because the OP has provided an update.","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":true,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2020-01-28T11:55:26Z","updated_at":"2020-11-28T22:00:42Z","closed_at":"2020-10-29T21:57:13Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":"resolved","sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"<!--\r\n\r\nMore information on our issue management policies can be found here: https://aka.ms/aspnet/issue-policies\r\n\r\nPlease keep in mind that the GitHub issue tracker is not intended as a general support forum, but for reporting non-security bugs and feature requests.\r\n\r\nIf you believe you have an issue that affects the SECURITY of the platform, please do NOT create an issue and instead email your issue details to secure@microsoft.com. Your report may be eligible for our [bug bounty](https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/msrc/bounty-dot-net-core) but ONLY if it is reported through email.\r\nFor other types of questions, consider using [StackOverflow](https://stackoverflow.com).\r\n\r\n-->\r\n\r\n### Describe the bug\r\nMSBuild can't resolve (default?) targets, e.g. `Build`, `ReBuild`, for \\*.wixproj files using **no** local WiX toolset installation. \r\nLooking at the Wix*.nupkg to be downloaded and the WiX property sheets, it should not be necessary to have a local installation of the WiX toolset prior to building. I think that references to WiX aren't resolved yet when the remaining projects are built \r\n\r\n### To Reproduce\r\nI followed the the [Build from Source guide](https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/blob/master/docs/BuildFromSource.md), installed all the prerequisites, adapted a pre-existing VS2019 installation, installed node, and the JDK (using the PowerShell script).\r\n\r\nAfterwards, I called `restore.cmd`, let it run - 0 warnings, 0 errors.\r\nThen, I opened Windows Installers solution as `startvs.cmd src/Installers/Windows/Installers.sln`, selected \"Release|x86\" and hit \"Rebuild\" on the solution. \r\nNow, some of the projects, i.e. iiscommon.lib and and iisca.lib built but for the WiX project \"SharedFramework\" I got the error message\r\n`The target \"Rebuild\" does not exist in the project.`\r\n\r\nBesides, possibly related: Visual Studio cannot load the setup projects `AncmIISExpressV2.wixproj` and `AncmV2.wixproj`. Both projects result in the message\r\n`error  : Unrecognized Guid format.`\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nWhat steps can we follow to reproduce the issue?\r\n\r\nWe ❤ code! Include a complete code listing or point us to a minimalistic GitHub repo.\r\n\r\n``` C#\r\nConsole.WriteLine(\"Hello, World!\");\r\n```\r\n\r\nGot Exceptions? Include both the message and the stack trace\r\n-->\r\n\r\n### Further technical details\r\n- ASP.NET Core version\r\nbranch: `master`, commit: `ebb2656e3ea4dd5199fb63925c6e14e99e432399`\r\n- Include the output of `dotnet --info`\r\n\r\nA compatible installed .NET Core SDK for global.json version [5.0.100-alpha.1.20063.3] from [C:\\Dev\\aspnetcore\\global.json] was not found\r\nInstall the [5.0.100-alpha.1.20063.3] .NET Core SDK or update [C:\\Dev\\aspnetcore\\global.json] with an installed .NET Core SDK:\r\n  2.1.509 [C:\\Program Files\\dotnet\\sdk]\r\n  2.1.511 [C:\\Program Files\\dotnet\\sdk]\r\n  2.2.106 [C:\\Program Files\\dotnet\\sdk]\r\n  2.2.300 [C:\\Program Files\\dotnet\\sdk]\r\n  3.1.101 [C:\\Program Files\\dotnet\\sdk]\r\n\r\nHost (useful for support):\r\n  Version: 3.1.1\r\n  Commit:  a1388f194c\r\n\r\n.NET Core SDKs installed:\r\n  2.1.509 [C:\\Program Files\\dotnet\\sdk]\r\n  2.1.511 [C:\\Program Files\\dotnet\\sdk]\r\n  2.2.106 [C:\\Program Files\\dotnet\\sdk]\r\n  2.2.300 [C:\\Program Files\\dotnet\\sdk]\r\n  3.1.101 [C:\\Program Files\\dotnet\\sdk]\r\n\r\n.NET Core runtimes installed:\r\n  Microsoft.AspNetCore.All 2.1.2 [C:\\Program Files\\dotnet\\shared\\Microsoft.AspNetCore.All]\r\n  Microsoft.AspNetCore.All 2.1.13 [C:\\Program Files\\dotnet\\shared\\Microsoft.AspNetCore.All]\r\n  Microsoft.AspNetCore.All 2.1.15 [C:\\Program Files\\dotnet\\shared\\Microsoft.AspNetCore.All]\r\n  Microsoft.AspNetCore.All 2.2.4 [C:\\Program Files\\dotnet\\shared\\Microsoft.AspNetCore.All]\r\n  Microsoft.AspNetCore.All 2.2.5 [C:\\Program Files\\dotnet\\shared\\Microsoft.AspNetCore.All]\r\n  Microsoft.AspNetCore.App 2.1.2 [C:\\Program Files\\dotnet\\shared\\Microsoft.AspNetCore.App]\r\n  Microsoft.AspNetCore.App 2.1.13 [C:\\Program Files\\dotnet\\shared\\Microsoft.AspNetCore.App]\r\n  Microsoft.AspNetCore.App 2.1.15 [C:\\Program Files\\dotnet\\shared\\Microsoft.AspNetCore.App]\r\n  Microsoft.AspNetCore.App 2.2.4 [C:\\Program Files\\dotnet\\shared\\Microsoft.AspNetCore.App]\r\n  Microsoft.AspNetCore.App 2.2.5 [C:\\Program Files\\dotnet\\shared\\Microsoft.AspNetCore.App]\r\n  Microsoft.AspNetCore.App 3.1.1 [C:\\Program Files\\dotnet\\shared\\Microsoft.AspNetCore.App]\r\n  Microsoft.NETCore.App 2.1.2 [C:\\Program Files\\dotnet\\shared\\Microsoft.NETCore.App]\r\n  Microsoft.NETCore.App 2.1.13 [C:\\Program Files\\dotnet\\shared\\Microsoft.NETCore.App]\r\n  Microsoft.NETCore.App 2.1.15 [C:\\Program Files\\dotnet\\shared\\Microsoft.NETCore.App]\r\n  Microsoft.NETCore.App 2.2.4 [C:\\Program Files\\dotnet\\shared\\Microsoft.NETCore.App]\r\n  Microsoft.NETCore.App 2.2.5 [C:\\Program Files\\dotnet\\shared\\Microsoft.NETCore.App]\r\n  Microsoft.NETCore.App 3.1.1 [C:\\Program Files\\dotnet\\shared\\Microsoft.NETCore.App]\r\n  Microsoft.WindowsDesktop.App 3.1.1 [C:\\Program Files\\dotnet\\shared\\Microsoft.WindowsDesktop.App]\r\n- The IDE (VS / VS Code/ VS4Mac) you're running on, and it's version\r\nVisual Studio Enterprise 2019 Version 16.4.3\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/issues/18619/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/issues/18619/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/issues/26064","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/issues/26064/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/issues/26064/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/issues/26064/events","html_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/pull/26064","id":704572554,"node_id":"MDExOlB1bGxSZXF1ZXN0NDg5NDc0MTA4","number":26064,"title":"Generate non-stable version for installer","user":{"login":"wtgodbe","id":14283640,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlc